     1,
     "Hi,<div><br></div><div>I am running SUSE version of Linux. How do we set-up and start shiny server on this. Were the following commands correct for installing node, R and shiny???</div><div><br></div><div><b>Node -</b></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1pt solid rgb(221,221,221);padding:5pt 8pt;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\">\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:14.25pt;border-style:none;padding:0in;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">sudo zypper ar\n<a href=\"http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel:/languages:/nodejs/openSUSE_12.3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel:/languages:/nodejs/openSUSE_12.3/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408506257000&amp;usg=AOvVaw30fGHDFqAWP-DbGsqQlj9f\">http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel:/languages:/nodejs/openSUSE_12.3/</a>\nNodeJSBuildService <u></u><u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:14.25pt;border-style:none;padding:0in;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:14.25pt;border-style:none;padding:0in;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">sudo zypper in nodejs nodejs-devel </span></p></div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><b><br></b></span></font></div><div><font face=\"monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><b>R -</b></span></font></div><div><pre style=\"background:#ddd9c3\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">VERSION=$(grep VERSION /etc/SuSE-release | sed -e &#39;s/VERSION = //&#39;)<u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre><pre style=\"background:#ddd9c3\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">zypper addrepo -f \\ <u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre><pre style=\"background:#ddd9c3\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><a href=\"http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel%5C:languages%5C:R%5C:patched/openSUSE_$VERSION/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel%255C:languages%255C:R%255C:patched/openSUSE_$VERSION/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408506257000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2w_PY_9J2n73mgJs5GWvxT\">http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel\\:languages\\:R\\:patched/openSUSE_$VERSION/</a> \\<u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre><pre style=\"background:#ddd9c3\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">R-patched<u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre><pre style=\"background:#ddd9c3\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><br></span></strong></pre><pre style=\"background:#ddd9c3\"><pre style=\"background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">zypper install R-patched R-patched-devel<u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre></pre></div><div><font face=\"monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><b>Shiny -</b></span></font></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">sudo su - -c &quot;R -e \\&quot;install.packages(&#39;shiny&#39;, repos=&#39;<a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408506257000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ffQYyJ7iS8B_ajO9asQ3m\">http://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;</a>)\\&quot;&quot;</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">npm install -g shiny-server</span></div></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">Please let me know if i miss anything?</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
