     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">If all of those completed without errors, and &quot;node -v&quot; gives you something later than 0.8.17 or so, then you should be in good shape.<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">You will need to start it using systemd, as that has replaced upstart as the init system in SuSE 12.1 according to wikipedia. Here&#39;s one Shiny Server user&#39;s attempt:</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?fromgroups#!topic/shiny-discuss/sTUmUL7znWg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?fromgroups%23!topic/shiny-discuss/sTUmUL7znWg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408506258000&amp;usg=AOvVaw227-PiXIyYv6ybJ0Itzimw\">https://groups.google.com/forum/?fromgroups#!topic/shiny-discuss/sTUmUL7znWg</a><br>\r\n\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\nOn Tue, Jun 11, 2013 at 1:47 AM, Sam <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">domalpa...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\nHi,<div><br></div><div>I am running SUSE version of Linux. How do we set-up and start shiny server on this. Were the following commands correct for installing node, R and shiny???</div><div><br></div><div><b>Node -</b></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1pt solid rgb(221,221,221);padding:5pt 8pt;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:14.25pt;border-style:none;padding:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">sudo zypper ar\r\n<a href=\"http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel:/languages:/nodejs/openSUSE_12.3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel:/languages:/nodejs/openSUSE_12.3/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408506258000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KKEzTyCL80gvEjMRsLX8Y\">http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel:/languages:/nodejs/openSUSE_12.3/</a>\r\nNodeJSBuildService <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:14.25pt;border-style:none;padding:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:14.25pt;border-style:none;padding:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">sudo zypper in nodejs nodejs-devel </span></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><b><br></b></span></font></div><div><font face=\"monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><b>R -</b></span></font></div><div><pre><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;\">VERSION=$(grep VERSION /etc/SuSE-release | sed -e &#39;s/VERSION = //&#39;)<u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n<pre><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;\">zypper addrepo -f \\ <u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre><pre><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;\"><a href=\"http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel%5C:languages%5C:R%5C:patched/openSUSE_$VERSION/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel%255C:languages%255C:R%255C:patched/openSUSE_$VERSION/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408506258000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38if1X4jAjgzAGpZCdrKQ4\">http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel\\:languages\\:R\\:patched/openSUSE_$VERSION/</a> \\<u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n<pre><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;\">R-patched<u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre><pre><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;\"><br></span></strong></pre><pre><pre style=\"background-repeat:initial initial\">\r\n\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;\">zypper install R-patched R-patched-devel<u></u><u></u></span></strong></pre></pre></div><div><font face=\"monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></font></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><b>Shiny -</b></span></font></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">sudo su - -c &quot;R -e \\&quot;install.packages(&#39;shiny&#39;, repos=&#39;<a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408506258000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1T1j4aWxZkaWdmgrmwJaJZ\">http://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;</a>)\\&quot;&quot;</span></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">npm install -g shiny-server</span></div></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:17px\">Please let me know if i miss anything?</span></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
